  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women, Peace and Security Conference</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The year 2025 is the 25th anniversary for the UNSC&apos;s resolution on Women Peace and Security (WPS). WPS is one of the core priorities in the Danish membership of the UNSC 2025-2026. The WPS conference will mark the 25th anniversary and  will shine a light on the main agendas of WPS, that are challenged all around the globe. The conference seeks to reflect upon new methods to ensure the full, equal and meaningful participation of women in peace processes and conflict mitigation and their protection in conflict settings.</narrative>
  </description>
